    "notes": "Types-of (last 4 types: door-arrivals, map-journey x3) and LEARNINGS asks for types-of next. Last types-of was 4 separate portraits with skip 53%; this one has one protagonist with one want (a kitty date) and a date chip, so every type is a reply that blocks her. Game played three times: Ruhi ordinary (every date a function), Myra sillier (3 days for a lehenga trial), Aditi absurd (free but will not come). Claim before reveal on Aditi ('Yay! Done!' then 'Par aaungi nahi'). Twist is seen: a phone notification and Ruhi's 'Card toh aapne hi bheja'. Shruti is the 4th type herself. Button mirrors the opening line with the date flipped into the wedding. Endings tried: Tuesday 11 am slot (soft), Aditi 'Har mahine yahi hota hai' (flat), kitty at the shaadi (kept, loops to the opening). Lead is Shruti, not Tanya (last reel). 4 characters, max 3 a shot, every two-line shot 8 words or fewer with hold 0.1, about 25 s at pace 28. Weddings start 21 Nov, so the topic is live this week."
